 the song without dying. You have a Blaster with infinite ammunition and single life to dodge or kill all the enemies that will appear to the music's rhythm.", "short_description": "Beat Blaster is a VR game of shooting, running, and dodging where everything happens to the music rhythm. An original mix of styles where each game will offer you a new challenge."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ivanovichgames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ivanovichgames.com/privacy.html", "publisher_name": "Ivanovich Games", "support_website_url": "https://www.ivanovichgames.com/web/contact/", "website_url": "https://www.ivanovichgames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["MUSIC", "SHOOTER", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de", "ko", "en", "pt_BR", "it", "fr", "es", "ja", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "469920751398902"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2782718895315617"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2782718895315617"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1620082080, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2782718895315617"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24902510452733444", "version": "1.99"}, "id": "1903559229802194", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus